### Mengirim data pendaftaran pengguna baru (Register User) 
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/institutions/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "user_{{$randomInt 100 999}}",
    "password": "password123",
    "email": "tester_{{$guid}}@gmail.com",
    "legal_sk_number": "SK-{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}",
    "npwp": "NPWP-{{$randomInt 100000 999999}}",
    "pub_permit_no": "PERMIT-{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}",
    "bank_account_no": "ACC-{{$randomInt 100000 999999}}",
    "bank_name": "Bank {{$randomInt 1 10}}",
    "bank_account_name": "user_{{$randomInt 100 999}}"
    }

### Mengirim data pendaftaran pengguna baru (Register User) email sama
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/institutions/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "user_{{$randomInt 100 999}}",
    "password": "password123",
    "email": "tester_sama@gmail.com",
    "legal_sk_number": "SK-{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}",
    "npwp": "NPWP-{{$randomInt 100000 999999}}",
    "pub_permit_no": "PERMIT-{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}",
    "bank_account_no": "ACC-{{$randomInt 100000 999999}}",
    "bank_name": "Bank {{$randomInt 1 10}}",
    "bank_account_name": "user_{{$randomInt 100 999}}",
    "verification_status": "PENDING",
    "is_frozen": false
}

