### Mengirim data login institusi
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/institutions/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "password": "password123",
    "email": "tester_sama@gmail.com"
}

### Mengirim data login institusi password salah
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/institutions/login/
